cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 4,952 new best-known packings of equal circles and spheres in sixteen Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-25
version: "2.3"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  4,952 packings that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables: equal circles in the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit square
  (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), 15-gon (cpd) and 16-gon (cxd), and equal spheres in the unit cube (scu), each with an exact
  certificate verified by two independently written exact checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature are excluded by a
  prior-art gate. Also: 58 table entries proven optimal by Füredi's bound for thin rectangles and two proven optimal by an exact
  computer-assisted proof.
